5. **Fifth**: Rewrite vendor app [subscription_screen.dart](file:///d:/flutter%20project/Gas%20User%20and%20Vendor%20App/vendorapp/lib/screens/subscription/subscription_screen.dart)
6. **Sixth**: Update [payment_submit_screen.dart](file:///d:/flutter%20project/Gas%20User%20and%20Vendor%20App/vendorapp/lib/screens/subscription/payment_submit_screen.dart) styling
7. **Seventh**: Clean up duplicate screens
