> [!IMPORTANT]
> The [subscription_payments.php](file:///d:/flutter%20project/Gas%20User%20and%20Vendor%20App/adminpanel/admin/subscription_payments.php) (payment verification page) **does NOT need to be rebuilt** — it's already fully functional with verify/reject modals, stats dashboard, and filter tabs. The new UI design images only cover the plan management page and vendor app, not the payment verification page.
